      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At auction, Rising Azure Cloud is announced as rank six cloud path, specialized in ascending and descending in the air, and metal, wood, water, fire, and earth are named more popular than cloud path and sound path.",
      "chapters": [
        752
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yun cultivates cloud path. Fang Di Chang says he allowed that earlier because Fang Yun’s lively nature suits cloud path, but also states that cloud path is only a minor path and can never compare to wisdom path. He still keeps Fang Yun on cloud path foundation rather than forcing a switch when handing over a wisdom path inheritance for the clan.",
